{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "9267bcde651307994748b60df08c66f6c4e06318c24f02e54095ac68f14f684f", "ja": "ショートドラマシアター", "zh": "短剧剧场", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "a40514e0d9ddf8b34927c0e18800d52845886d7f0607aa1af3a7b0586961e97e", "ja": "ミリラジ内で行われているショートドラマ\nシアターの内容に不満を抱いた静香。覆面\n構成作家『タカナシ・ネオン』に直接要望\nを伝えようとするものの、相手が小鳥だと\n察するや手のひらを返し絶賛するのだった。", "zh": "Million Radio节目中进行的短剧\n静香对剧场的内容感到不满。她本想将要求\n直接传达给蒙面编剧“高梨霓虹”，却在察觉\n对方是小鸟后态度骤变，转而大加赞赏。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_04_1000_022ser", "source_sha256": "0c8840ec22d71b4d027782dedd9956a7802cc98867bd3c0045ef4673a2e07a2e", "ja": "ミリラジ・ショートドラマシアター。\n第5話『オーディション』", "zh": "百万电台短剧剧场。\n第5话《试镜》", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_04_1001_015siz", "source_sha256": "aa2737f8ad9e1185eb2bc383d295453ad57a68fd63e3a39bf16d82cdb2169068", "ja": "はぁ。そろそろオーディションかぁ。\n絶対合格したいから、台本、読み込んでおかないと。", "zh": "唉，差不多该去参加试镜了。\n因为想一定通过，得把剧本好好读熟才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_04_1002_015siz", "source_sha256": "7bf13183604f4fb346d992aa72c9902ed5e8b9edc6d8b929eb46a53b1a2b47e1", "ja": "ねえ未来。台本の読み合わせ、付き合ってくれない？", "zh": "未来，可以陪我对一下台词吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_04_1003_014mir", "source_sha256": "ef6352ec04ec51f0b3f7db85909cff84773ef1aa857ef1b0d9069af72aaf6d73", "ja": "オッケー♪　静香ちゃんが受ける役はミリ子だよね。\nじゃあ私はミリ夫をやるね。", "zh": "好呀♪　静香要演的角色是美里子吧。\n那我来演美里夫。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_04_1004_014mir", "source_sha256": "0248a13e12775ed3862b26395f94a2ab92c73538494629724f72bdf4f28a2f15", "ja": "「ミリ子ちゃん、\n僕は君がいないと生きていけないんだ！」", "zh": "“未来子，\n没有你我活不下去！”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_04_1005_015siz", "source_sha256": "e66e37dcd1c1d2a5617b87229821daa0c34e58b40cfc1d9a6492611b454323a1", "ja": "「ミリ夫さん、どうしてもっと早くそれを言って\nくれなかったの？　もう、終わった話よ」", "zh": "「美里夫先生，为什么你没有早点对我说出\n那句话呢？我们之间，已经结束了」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_04_1006_014mir", "source_sha256": "228246a786231d83497ee337498897d0ee2c9465bb611d1f068675b500b4f3e3", "ja": "静香ちゃん、今の台詞、どういう気持ちで演じてた？", "zh": "静香，你刚才那句台词，是带着怎样的心情演的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_04_1007_015siz", "source_sha256": "19091ddd2afe77b42ea1d88cdf6113e904f6ba9808bf7b6549326814c05e9344", "ja": "どういう気持ちって……。\n少しだけ未練があるけど、もう昔には戻れない、とか。", "zh": "所谓什么心情……  \n就是虽然还有一点留恋，但已经回不到过去了，之类的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_04_1008_014mir", "source_sha256": "0db2727068d2cf4323998a9fbb98d855faa1dc0f177bd980c941b298dbdb324d", "ja": "もっと本気で演じないと、魂は伝わらないよ。", "zh": "不演得更认真一点，是无法传达灵魂的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_04_1009_015siz", "source_sha256": "d7378eacc3661b1c3da4fa071e3d8312aea7c79549e82f4dff299d5807b0e826", "ja": "み、未来？\n私が頼んだのは、読み合わせなんだけど……？", "zh": "未、未来？\n我拜托的是对台词来着……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_04_1010_014mir", "source_sha256": "59e5c21c34ea6c32b603fd209a7d813890ddbde1081d73dbc5e949da58580cde", "ja": "うん。今のは監督の台詞。", "zh": "嗯。刚才那是导演的台词。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_04_1011_015siz", "source_sha256": "f66dc0c2a8f206e9e9f4ea492e992d5a988a2f05c011901433f1da9c59fb1deb", "ja": "監督の役はいらないの！\n台本だけ読んでよ。", "zh": "我不要导演这个角色啦！\n你只要读剧本就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_04_1012_014mir", "source_sha256": "514c18d7b539c3e1d91bdf5cabd88553482d0aaf41de53af0c0004d6f9be992f", "ja": "でもオーディションに出るんだから、\n絶対監督と会話するはずだもん。", "zh": "可是既然要参加试镜，就肯定会和导演说话的嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_04_1013_014mir", "source_sha256": "ac0c6d25e9b2bc3f00a3965fb054f47956c3fd4d549e805e2ac578d737b81dd7", "ja": "そんなにあまちゃんじゃ、一次試験突破も無理だね。\n次！", "zh": "这么天真的话，连第一轮考核都过不了哦。\n下一个！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_04_1014_015siz", "source_sha256": "ea3316d2c711face7d23c6ead65d9a8758ac350ca6bea58115f479e3f6fa63e4", "ja": "つ、次！？", "zh": "等、等等！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_04_1015_022ser", "source_sha256": "40c1fca90d9223bf08f593e8ed3740dff464b7d3fdc3180b7f247af2678196ff", "ja": "負け犬はどいてください。\n次はわたしの番です。", "zh": "输家请让开。接下来轮到我了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_04_1016_015siz", "source_sha256": "dc66672228ce3b1609214da16885d7c345310267e99db8147e5bb6881cb74e48", "ja": "他のオーディション参加者もいるの！？", "zh": "还有其他参加试镜的人！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_04_1017_022ser", "source_sha256": "fc1360c3a724e1fdba073c0d913bc5d1cf48ff9100283393891d5ccdd2f71a63", "ja": "絶対にこの役をつかんでやる……。このオーディション\nに受からなきゃ、ママはわたしを愛してくれないの！", "zh": "我一定要拿下这个角色……要是没能通过这次试镜，妈妈就不会爱我了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_04_1018_015siz", "source_sha256": "f0566b5578ccf2638088b89c66319c149d12f6f2e30cc7427cb31994e2fcfd83", "ja": "なんかキャラ設定が濃いんだけど！？", "zh": "角色设定也太浓烈了吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_04_1019_014mir", "source_sha256": "65199ce77992a8e780ffe44a1497f3d23e7be5361389ae881b49f1bbf3a39fb3", "ja": "次は静香ちゃんのアドリブだよ。星梨花の気迫に気圧さ\nれつつ、オーディション参加者の自覚が生まれる台詞！", "zh": "接下来是静香的即兴发挥。虽然被星梨花的气势压倒，却也产生了自己是试镜参加者的自觉的台词！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_04_1020_015siz", "source_sha256": "ee37a39a4176a64a943add531dc5f5745e8fce8f4fbf96d109a0d11589abeba6", "ja": "ええ……？　……こ、ここで負けるわけにはいかない。\n監督、もう一度やらせてください！", "zh": "诶……？……不、不能在这里输掉。\n导演，请再让我来一次！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_04_1021_014mir", "source_sha256": "45d0b3697c5e4ede4eb1c06bb481841bb54873cecf9d73ba11047c4879f7f322", "ja": "フッ……あなた面白い子ね。\nならばもう一度ステージに上がりなさい！", "zh": "呵……你这孩子真有意思。\n那就再一次登上舞台吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_04_1022_022ser", "source_sha256": "915245bf2176da3505e14510f3d37258dc3aa74ef086e4e68f51eebd07655392", "ja": "なんで！？　なんであの子ばっかり……。\nこうなったら邪魔してやる。何をしてでも……！", "zh": "为什么！？为什么只有那孩子……  \n既然这样，我就去妨碍她。不管用什么手段……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_04_1023_014mir", "source_sha256": "1f5e6f60ffc3f3023f121e413d1f6a9e88b11271235b6b503b600ac0cf6df114", "ja": "トゥービーコンティニュー！", "zh": "未完待续！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_04_1024_015siz", "source_sha256": "d9e57685ae698221ebb1ee07c6745b0f2488b1a08b9161a58a9074b60bf1386a", "ja": "……{$P$}。\nあのドラマコーナー、なんなんですか？", "zh": "……{$P$}。\n那个短剧环节，到底是怎么回事啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_04_1025_015siz", "source_sha256": "6294b70085ea080857b24f3fb8c8f9b5f696c1f3e1fa2258b053964d41d4532d", "ja": "毎回毎回、わけのわからない寸劇をやらされて。\nしかも、いつも私が不憫な感じで終わるんですけど。", "zh": "每次每次都要被迫演莫名其妙的短剧。\n而且每次最后都搞得好像只有我特别惨。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_04_1026_p", "source_sha256": "0e27f47262d248872f46d31653bd1e8d61eef9e0183250420c5e27d020490229", "ja": "でも好評じゃないか。\n前回も面白かったって、すごく反響があったよな？", "zh": "不过反响不是很好吗？\n上次也有很多人说很有意思，反响很热烈吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_04_1027_015siz", "source_sha256": "efc5af155d25a7bbcddb3f83dd7ebbd7077152d52d7c78e0c3cd7af10ed82d65", "ja": "そ、そうですけど、私はワンパターンじゃないかって\nいってるんです！　私の、イメージにも関わりますし。", "zh": "是、是这样没错，可我说的是不是太千篇一律了！这也关系到我的形象。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_04_1028_p", "source_sha256": "63c5303822c92349d66088f312bc56fe7714c52d39d671bce0cd4ff9b44acb5c", "ja": "なるほど。\nまあ、どうしても脚本に不満があるなら……。", "zh": "原来如此。嗯，如果你实在对剧本不满意的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_04_1029_p", "source_sha256": "b8206fdd0bd9637e46b6a81ab2cebe178549b7df4eda4561b02548a471436cbb", "ja": "ミリラジシアターは、覆面構成作家のタカナシ・ネオン\n先生が書いてるんだ。今から先生に直接言ってみるか？", "zh": "百万电台剧场是由蒙面编剧タカナシ・ネオン老师创作的。要不要现在直接去跟老师说说看？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_04_1030_015siz", "source_sha256": "caff42be715614cefbf124322dcd4db5edb4947f6aaf414add6152051e6640fd", "ja": "え？　……べ、別にいいですよ。\n私、間違ったことは言ってないですから。", "zh": "诶？……没、没关系。\n我又没说错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_04_1031_p", "source_sha256": "49a55f1748040f97bdbc1cbb65e7600c40130291ef69fe269712f8ab141aca95", "ja": "よし、少し待っててくれ。\nネオン先生とはいつもリモート会議で話してるんだ。", "zh": "好，稍微等我一下。\n我平时都是通过远程会议和霓虹老师交流的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_04_1032_p", "source_sha256": "e257e7909b364aac3ab6645aab414ec2dfa35eee465c468e974b9927bc9fe54c", "ja": "えっと、アプリを起動して……お、つながった。", "zh": "呃，先启动应用……哦，连上了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_04_1033_p", "source_sha256": "92b99220713308673715a7471629dcc5d249d8a2182c0ac79ef3cddabffa0316", "ja": "ネオン先生、今ちょっといいですか。", "zh": "霓虹老师，现在方便吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_04_1034_101kot", "source_sha256": "b2332736751a011e5b82015bd5e2d5d9f55ec01c916391e2544dbc094f4fbf0a", "ja": "はーい。なんでしょうか。", "zh": "好的——有什么事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_04_1035_p", "source_sha256": "8d14c472a4512decdb939da643842622df45c9f81340c9bd2d50d3f58421c25d", "ja": "静香がネオン先生に話があるみたいで、\nちょっと聞いてやってくれますか？", "zh": "静香好像有话想和霓虹老师说，可以请你听她说一会儿吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_04_1036_101kot", "source_sha256": "29bce6b172043e01c1dbc82c24b68af11fd06392e7f7e66f4b340af14f7f896b", "ja": "静香ちゃ、じゃなくて、最上静香さんが？\nゴホ、ゴホン……いいですよ。", "zh": "是静香……不对，是最上静香？咳、咳咳……好啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_04_1037_015siz", "source_sha256": "58ad88317319a4bd31f287e8d292c8c2844a0e379a4322fe0c06304a84a257f6", "ja": "あれ……？\nその声……、小鳥さん？", "zh": "咦……？\n这个声音……是小鸟小姐？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_04_1038_101kot", "source_sha256": "7716621dc03423aa384ae68fa20b82adba00ec0636d93b0f278d076378f48e5f", "ja": "え……？　だ、誰のことでしょう。\n私は覆面構成作家のタカナシ・ネオンです。", "zh": "诶……？您、您说的是谁呀。\n我是蒙面编剧小鸟游霓虹。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_04_1039_015siz", "source_sha256": "90a772c3a89ddcbfa0089dd9e05104ef75ee2a6d4856fd655585dd9228131093", "ja": "やっぱり小鳥さんですよね？", "zh": "果然是小鸟小姐吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_04_1040_101kot", "source_sha256": "dc74191f223c9ebaffca40942033b95f5fab991dc007e674d9836fa743e5ba87", "ja": "わ、私にはなんのことやら……。そ、それより！\n静香さんは私にお話があるんですよね？", "zh": "我、我怎么会知道呢……。那、那先不说这个！\n静香小姐有话要对我说，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_04_1041_015siz", "source_sha256": "6b70731d301a73a190a94e46b2a3871f50b9622d819b037cef8d19b1b0218ebe", "ja": "お話……、というほどのことじゃ\nないんですけど……。", "zh": "说是有话要说……其实也没什么大不了的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_04_1042_101kot", "source_sha256": "a3319f31de881a85afd7b0b037fe975ba693d531ef8bf03faf5181c94498cb09", "ja": "なんでも言ってくれていいんですよ。こういう台詞に\n不満があるとか、こういう展開にしてほしいとか。", "zh": "有什么话都可以尽管告诉我哦。比如对这样的台词有什么不满，或者希望剧情朝这样的方向发展之类的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_04_1043_015siz", "source_sha256": "99b35bbc1551c15a5b362c08637c5f403d18994e584923575a1052b59d3e2f7a", "ja": "ふ、不満なんて！　その……、\nいつも楽しいお話をありがとうございます。", "zh": "不、不满什么的！那个……一直谢谢您带来这么有趣的故事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_04_1044_015siz", "source_sha256": "27b8e0f4920936b28e7e5785d28a3c85ce08944be99dc983f72448779b639105", "ja": "特に、先週の第4回は神回でした！　今週はちょっと\n不思議な展開で驚きましたけど、面白かったです！", "zh": "尤其是上周的第4集，简直是神回！这周的展开有点奇怪，虽然让我很惊讶，但也很有意思！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_04_1045_101kot", "source_sha256": "161017643008af4983e14f334b9d1bf1612d40a3b1b7964e03c589da4e8225ed", "ja": "あらっ、褒めてくれるんですか？\nうふふ、感想をもらえるとやる気につながります♪", "zh": "哎呀，你是在夸我吗？\n呵呵，能收到感想，就更有干劲了呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_04_1046_015siz", "source_sha256": "d9501cdc7c330cdbacf4f75e48ee952cec42d836b2937f8fc0e53ce05197a80b", "ja": "いつもどうしてこんなお話が思いつけるんだろうって。\n今度また創作のお話を聞かせてください！", "zh": "我总是在想，你怎么能想出这样的故事呢。\n下次请务必再跟我聊聊创作上的事！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_04_1047_101kot", "source_sha256": "4f44a4882b739b495896aca1a7aa48bfb5b9ac8c03d4b30cfefd312343cf90ac", "ja": "もちろん♪　私も静香ちゃ、静香さん達の話を\n聞いて、お話づくりに活かしたいです♪", "zh": "当然♪我也想听听静香……静香小姐她们的故事，用在故事创作上♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_04_1048_p", "source_sha256": "2672bc5fde73591c8a5a71485276cc67944b3d91593e294eb554a76b626eac16", "ja": "……なんだか話が弾んでるみたいだな。", "zh": "……看来聊得很投机呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_04_1049_014mir", "source_sha256": "e0b03fe25cd350df201c163333957dac15a4ed7fbbc3e3bbac66c8dd30aed21d", "ja": "静香ちゃん、{$P$}さんには\nとりあえず文句言っちゃうとこあるよね～。", "zh": "静香，你总是会先抱怨{$P$}先生呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_04_1050_022ser", "source_sha256": "cdc230802b22c64f0a9b3cdd04baeafa678f6b37151b6be42c3af768070dc0a1", "ja": "そうですね。きっと、何か思いついたら\nすぐ相談したくなるんだと思います♪", "zh": "是啊。我想，她肯定是一想到什么，就会马上想找人商量吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
